  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f60;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a7477857-0f35-4c95-a44f-e96bb19844f5.png\" width=\"720\" height=\"379\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f60\">&nbsp;»更多<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasy-weapons-medieval-series\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇幻</a>，更多<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩</a>！«<br><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\">必要模組與擴充：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasy-weapons-medieval-series\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇幻武器</a>、&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩戰鬥</a>、&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇蹟武器</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩戰鬥關刀動作集</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩戰鬥：重生</a>。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">此資料包為史詩戰鬥與奇幻武器模組新增相容性！</span><br></span><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f90\">⁑特色功能⁑</span></p><p>1. &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">超過42種獨特動作組合！沒錯，每把武器都擁有專屬戰鬥風格。</span></span><br>2. &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">部分武器支援雙持或持盾戰鬥模式（雙矛與雙斧真實重現:D）<br></span></span>3. &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">更多動畫！我重新匯入了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此資源包（由asanginxst製作）</a>及其他擴充如奇蹟武器的動畫</span></span><br>4. &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\">重新平衡所有武器屬性</span><br>5. &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\">如展示影片所示，部分武器的動作組合可透過副手持握其他武器/工具來切換</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br>目前此資料包尚有3-5款武器未完全相容，若您喜歡此擴充，我將在未來嘗試修復！<br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">！以下為展示影片！<br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/k2as9rZMgPU?si=7u_6A1Fs6rD9e0C8\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_y2NM9Blmf4\" width=\"800\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><del>另外我真的很討厭寫程式，對我來說太困難了</del><span style=\"color:#000\">…<br>希望您能享受這個資料包帶來的樂趣！</span></span></span></span></span></p>",
